{
	"$schema": "http://127.0.0.1:5186/schema/registry-item.json",
	"name": "item",
	"title": "Item 内容项",
	"type": "registry:ui",
	"description": "显示媒体、标题、说明和操作的内容行。",
	"devDependencies": [
		"tailwind-variants@^3.3.0"
	],
	"registryDependencies": [
		"separator"
	],
	"meta": {
		"valar": {
			"keywords": [
				"内容项",
				"item",
				"列表项",
				"list item",
				"行"
			],
			"whenToUse": [
				"显示带图标或头像、标题、说明和操作的内容行",
				"用 Item.Group 组成列表"
			],
			"whenNotToUse": [
				{
					"case": "表单控件",
					"use": "field"
				},
				{
					"case": "大块的分组内容",
					"use": "card"
				},
				{
					"case": "行列结构化数据",
					"use": "table"
				}
			],
			"accessibility": [
				"整行可点击时用 child 渲染为真实链接或按钮",
				"只有图标的操作要加 aria-label"
			],
			"responsive": [
				"size（default、sm、xs）适应紧凑空间",
				"窄屏下操作区可换行"
			],
			"related": [
				"card",
				"field",
				"avatar"
			]
		}
	},
	"files": [
		{
			"content": "# Item 设计规范\n\n- 用于列表中的一行内容（设置项、文件、成员）：媒体放 `Item.Media`（`variant` 为 `icon` 或 `image`），文字放 `Item.Content`（`Item.Title`、`Item.Description`），操作放 `Item.Actions`。\n- 常规内容行通过 `variant`（`default`、`outline`、`muted`）和 `size`（`default`、`sm`、`xs`）选择样式与密度。\n- 问题列表用 `appearance=\"issue-row\"`。优先级在 `Item.Media`，编号、状态、标题在 `Item.Content`，日期在 `Item.Actions`。使用可访问文本表达图标所代表的优先级与状态。\n- 整行可点击时用 `child` snippet 把 `props` 传给 `<a href>` 渲染为链接，不要给 div 加 `onclick`；行内还有其他按钮时不要把整行做成链接，避免嵌套交互元素。\n- 多个 Item 放进 `Item.Group`：它渲染 `role=\"list\"`，组内每个 Item 要设 `role=\"listitem\"`；行之间需要分隔线时用 `Item.Separator`。\n- 问题行的状态、编号和日期保留在各自区域，空间不足时截断标题。用 `aria-current` 标明当前导航项。不可打开的行使用静态内容和 `aria-disabled`。\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "item/RULES.md"
		},
		{
			"content": "import Actions from \"./item-actions.svelte\";\nimport Content from \"./item-content.svelte\";\nimport Description from \"./item-description.svelte\";\nimport Footer from \"./item-footer.svelte\";\nimport Group from \"./item-group.svelte\";\nimport Header from \"./item-header.svelte\";\nimport Media from \"./item-media.svelte\";\nimport Separator from \"./item-separator.svelte\";\nimport Title from \"./item-title.svelte\";\nimport Root from \"./item.svelte\";\n\nexport {\n\tRoot,\n\tGroup,\n\tSeparator,\n\tHeader,\n\tFooter,\n\tContent,\n\tTitle,\n\tDescription,\n\tActions,\n\tMedia,\n\t//\n\tRoot as Item,\n\tGroup as ItemGroup,\n\tSeparator as ItemSeparator,\n\tHeader as ItemHeader,\n\tFooter as ItemFooter,\n\tContent as ItemContent,\n\tTitle as ItemTitle,\n\tDescription as ItemDescription,\n\tActions as ItemActions,\n\tMedia as ItemMedia,\n};\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "item/index.ts"
		},
		{
			"content": "<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport { cn, type WithElementRef } from \"$UTILS$.js\";\n\timport type { HTMLAttributes } from \"svelte/elements\";\n\n\tlet {\n\t\tref = $bindable(null),\n\t\tclass: className,\n\t\tchildren,\n\t\t...restProps\n\t}: WithElementRef<HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>> = $props();\n</script>\n\n<div\n\tbind:this={ref}\n\tdata-slot=\"item-actions\"\n\tclass={cn(\"gap-2 flex max-w-full flex-wrap items-center\", className)}\n\t{...restProps}\n>\n\t{@render children?.()}\n</div>\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "item/item-actions.svelte"
		},
		{
			"content": "<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport { cn, type WithElementRef } from \"$UTILS$.js\";\n\timport type { HTMLAttributes } from \"svelte/elements\";\n\n\tlet {\n\t\tref = $bindable(null),\n\t\tclass: className,\n\t\tchildren,\n\t\t...restProps\n\t}: WithElementRef<HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>> = $props();\n</script>\n\n<div\n\tbind:this={ref}\n\tdata-slot=\"item-content\"\n\tclass={cn(\n\t\t\"gap-1 group-data-[size=xs]/item:gap-0 flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col [&+[data-slot=item-content]]:flex-none\",\n\t\tclassName\n\t)}\n\t{...restProps}\n>\n\t{@render children?.()}\n</div>\n",
